id: 8
hanzi: 见解
pinyin: jiàn jiě
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: opinion; view; insight; perspective; interpretation
  es: opinión; punto de vista; criterio; apreciación; juicio

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | a thoughtful, reasoned understanding or insightful perspective on a problem, theory, or art | comprensión meditada, criterio fundado o juicio crítico sobre una materia, arte o teoría | 独到的见解 (original and insightful perspective)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 在学术研讨会上，这位年轻博士对传统文化在当代的传播提出了许多独到的见解，引起了与会专家的热烈讨论。 | Zài xuéshù yántǎohuì shàng, zhè wèi niánqīng bóshì duì chuántǒng wénhuà zài dāngdài de chuánbō tíchū le xǔduō dúdào de jiànjiě, yǐnqǐ le yùhuì zhuānjiā de rèliè tǎolùn. | At the symposium, this young doctoral graduate proposed many original insights into contemporary transmission of traditional culture, sparking lively discussion. | En el simposio, el joven doctor expuso criterios muy originales sobre la divulgación de las tradiciones, generando un vivo debate entre los expertos.
  #2 | 鲁迅对文学评论与社会批判有着极为深刻的见解，往往几句话就能切中要害，揭示问题的本质所在。 | Lǔ Xùn duì wénxué pínglùn yǔ shèhuì pīpàn yǒuzhe jíwéi shēnkè de jiànjiě, wǎngwǎng jǐ jù huà jiù néng qièzhòng-yàohài, jiēshì wèntí de běnzhì suǒzài. | Lu Xun possessed profound insights into literary criticism and social commentary, often striking the core of issues in just a few sentences. | Lu Xun poseía un criterio perspicaz sobre la crítica literaria y social; con pocas frases daba en el clavo, revelando la entraña del dilema.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  独到见解 | original insight
  深刻见解 | profound view/insight
  发表见解 | express one's views
  精辟见解 | incisive and brilliant insight
  专业见解 | professional perspective
  个人见解 | personal opinion

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  真知灼见 | zhēn zhī zhuó jiàn | penetrating insight; real and profound knowledge
  仁者见仁 | rén zhě jiàn rén | the benevolent sees benevolence; different views according to character
  高瞻远瞩 | gāo zhān yuǎn zhǔ | stand high and gaze far; broad, farsighted perspective
  各执一词 | gè zhí yì cí | each clings stubbornly to their own opinion

character_decomposition[2]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  见 | jiàn | see; view; observe; meet | ver; percibir; opinión; encontrarse | 见 | see | 目 (eye) + 儿 (legs of an observer) | 见 (jiàn) | 4 | 单一结构 | Oracle bone pictogram showing an exaggerated human eye 目 mounted upon a walking person 儿, meaning conscious sight and observation. | An open eye (目) looking out across the landscape allows a thinker to observe (见) and reflect on reality. | Un ojo atento (目) escruta el entorno permitiendo al observador ver (见) y reflexionar. | 51 | BHU | 見
  解 | jiě | dissect; untie; solve; understand; explain | desatar; desmembrar; resolver; comprender | 角 | horn | 角 (horn) + 刀 (knife/dissect) + 牛 (ox) | 刀 (dāo, cut) | 13 | 左右结构 | Ancient ideogram showing using a sharp knife 刀 to cut the horns 角 from an ox 牛, meaning analytical dissection and intellectual understanding. | A knife (刀) carefully cuts apart the horns (角) of an ox (牛) to dissect, untie, and understand (解) the anatomy. | El cuchillo (刀) separa con destreza las astas (角) del buey (牛), simbolizando la disección y el entendimiento (解). | 214 | NBHNQ | ""

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Observe with clear sight (见) and analytically dissect the details (解) to form a brilliant insight (见解).
  composite_memory_hook_es: Observa con mirada clara (见) y desmenuza con precisión (解) para forjar un criterio lúcido (见解).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: Combining visual perception (见) with logical dissection (解); implies that true opinion is not baseless gossip, but an analyzed deconstruction of empirical facts.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Falling tone followed by dipping tone: 'jiàn jiě' (51-214). Sharp drop on 'jiàn', followed by a full undulating 3rd tone on 'jiě'.

traps_and_cognates:
  look_alikes[4]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,distinction_note}:
    贝 | bèi | shell; money | Bottom legs 儿 are closed into two short dots 八
    触 | chù | touch; strike | Has 虫 on the right side of 角 instead of 刀 and 牛
    规 | guī | rule; regulation | Has 见 on right, but 夫 on left instead of standalone 见
    现 | xiàn | appear; present | Has jade radical 王 on the left
  etymological_cognates[4]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
    观 | guān | view; perspective; observe
    觉 | jué | perceive; awaken; feel
    析 | xī | analyze; split wood cleanly
    释 | shì | explain; unloose; liberate

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 见解 denotes an intellectual, analytical judgment formed through rational synthesis and deep expertise.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 见解 vs. 意见 | yìjiàn | 见解 refers to scholarly or philosophical insights and assessments, while 意见 often denotes practical suggestions, complaints, or divergent disagreements.
    2 | 见解 vs. 看法 | kànfǎ | 看法 is an everyday, general term for any personal impression or opinion, whereas 见解 implies greater analytical depth and formal reasoning.
    3 | 见解 vs. 观点 | guāndiǎn | 观点 emphasizes one's fundamental ideological stance or angle of observation, while 见解 emphasizes the reasoned conclusions drawn.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 读书的真谛不仅在于汲取既成知识，更在于培养独立思考的见解。不盲从权威，不随波逐流，在经典与现实的碰撞中叩问真理。唯有经过理性淘洗的思想，才能沉淀为属于自己的精神坐标，照亮前行之路。 | Dúshū de zhēndì bùjǐn zàiyú jíqǔ jìchéng zhīshi, gèng zàiyú péiyǎng dúlì-sīkǎo de jiànjiě. Bù mángcóng quánwēi, bù suíbō-zhúliú, zài jīngdiǎn yǔ xiànshí de pèngzhuàng zhōng kòuwèn zhēnlǐ. Wéiyǒu jīngguò lǐxìng táoxǐ de sīxiǎng, cáinéng chéndiàn wéi shǔyú zìjǐ de jīngshén zuòbiāo, zhàoliàng qiánxíng zhī lù. | The essence of reading lies not just in absorbing knowledge, but cultivating independent insights. Questioning truth without blind obedience to authority turns reasoned thoughts into inner spiritual coordinates that light one's path forward. | El valor de la lectura radica en forjar un juicio propio e independiente. Quien no se somete a dogmas ni sigue modas interroga la verdad. Solo el pensamiento decantado por la razón se transforma en una brújula que orienta los pasos.
  #2 | 面对瞬息万变的全球宏观局势，智库学者必须保持敏锐的洞察力。通过多源大数据的交叉印证，专家们在能源安全与产业布局上发表了一系列富有远见的专业见解，为国家制定中长期发展战略提供了强有力的智力支撑。 | Miànduì shùnxī-wànbiàn de quánqiú hóngguān júshì, zhìkù xuézhě bìxū bǎochí mǐnruì de dòngchálì. Tōngguò duōyuán dàshùjù de jiāochā yìnzhèng, zhuānjiāmen zài néngyuán ānquán yǔ chǎnyè bùjú shàng fābiǎo le yíxìliè fùyǒu yuǎnjiàn de zhuānyè jiànjiě, wèi guójiā zhìdìng zhōng-chángqī fāzhǎn zhànlüè tígōng le qiángyǒulì de zhìlì zhīchēng. | Facing fast-shifting global trends, think-tank scholars must maintain sharp insight. Cross-verifying big data, experts have published visionary perspectives on energy security and industrial layout, providing robust intellectual support for national strategy. | Ante la volátil coyuntura mundial, los analistas deben afinar la mirada. Cruzando macrodatos fiables, los expertos han formulado dictámenes de gran alcance sobre seguridad energética e industria, brindando sólido respaldo estratégico.
